sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Edge as Cloudflare Edge
    participant Origin as Express Origin
    User->>Browser: Open gallery
    Browser->>Edge: GET /static/img/banner.jpg
    Note over Edge: No reusable local entry (simple one-tier case)
    Edge->>Origin: GET same asset
    Origin-->>Edge: 200 JPEG + Cache-Control + origin timestamp
    Note over Edge: Store if eligible under active rules
    Edge-->>Browser: JPEG + actual CF-Cache-Status
    Browser-->>User: Render image
